<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-SAO PAULO CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT/FINAL STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SAO PAULO CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT/FINAL STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Sao Paulo championship, final stage match played Thursday.</p>
<p> Sao Paulo	     1   Corinthians	  1</p>
<p>Played Wednesday</p>
<p> Santos		  4   Palmeiras	    0</p>
<p>Final standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points, points in qualifying stage)</p>
<p> Corinthians		 3  2  1  0  7  4  7 45</p>
<p> Sao Paulo		   3  2  1  0  6  2  7 40</p>
<p> Santos			3  1  0  2  7  5  3 46</p>
<p> Palmeiras		   3  0  0  3  1 10  0 48</p>
<p>Note: if teams are level on points, positions are decided by the number of points in the qualifying stage. Teams play each other once in the final stage.</p>
<p>Corinthians champions</p>
</text>
